# Normalise line endings so the repository is byte-identical regardless of the
# platform it was authored on. Without this, a Windows checkout commits CRLF
# and a reviewer on macOS or Linux sees every line of every file as changed --
# which buries the actual diff.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` stores LF in the repository and checks out LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary payloads: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Evidence is generated output. Marking it explicitly keeps a stray CRLF in a
# captured page snapshot from being rewritten, which would break the SHA-256
# transcript digests recorded in artifact provenance.
evidence/**/*.png binary
